  "notes": "<p>Forbin&#39;s and Mockingbird were performed for the first time since July 30, 2017 (114 shows). Trey teased In Memory of Elizabeth Reed in Stash. Axilla (Part II) was performed for the first time since December 31, 1995 (858 shows). Fish mentioned Lee &quot;Scratch&quot; Perry (who had recently passed away) in the Hood intro. Fee featured Trey on megaphone. This was the rescheduled date from the show that had been postponed due to the coronavirus COVID-19 outbreak in 2020. The new date was originally supposed to occur at Lake Tahoe Outdoor Arena at Harveys in Stateline, NV but was changed due to wildfires in the area.</p>",
